# Build-time only: keep Recommends from dragging a second desktop into the
# image. pcmanfm-qt recommends lxqt-policykit and lxqt-qtplugin, which pull
# lxqt-session (an LXQt entry on the sign-in screen), its autostart entries,
# xscreensaver and a printer applet. (lxqt-sudo and liblxqt stay: pcmanfm-qt
# depends on them.)
Package: lxqt-session lxqt-config lxqt-policykit lxqt-qtplugin lxqt-powermanagement lxqt-notificationd lxqt-themes lxqt-system-theme lximage-qt xdg-desktop-portal-lxqt xscreensaver xscreensaver-data xscreensaver-gl qps qlipper oxygen-icon-theme system-config-printer system-config-printer-common system-config-printer-udev galternatives
Pin: release *
Pin-Priority: -1
